舒尔: 需要帮忙吗？
Shure: Need any help?

330
00:54:03,700 --> 00:54:05,633
卡特里娜: 如果你想的话，还有一块板可以弄
Katrina: There's another board you can work on if you want

331
00:54:27,833 --> 00:54:30,333
塔莎: 我觉得这个版本里Lissandra最强
Tasha: I think Lissandra is the strongest in this version

332
00:54:30,900 --> 00:54:32,066
塔莎: 在5费卡中
Tasha: Among the 5-cost cards

333
00:54:33,766 --> 00:54:34,766
塔莎: 嗯
Tasha: Hmm

334
00:54:34,933 --> 00:54:37,733
塔莎: 在Irelia和Wukong之间，Wukong强一点
Tasha: Between Irelia and Wukong, Wukong is a bit stronger

335
00:54:48,300 --> 00:54:49,200
尼克斯: 该死
Nicous: Damn

336
00:54:49,700 --> 00:54:51,466
塔莎: 说真的，你想要什么？
Tasha: Seriously, what do you want?

337
00:54:55,300 --> 00:54:56,300
塔莎: 你可以拿第二名
Tasha: You can take the second place

338
00:54:56,300 --> 00:54:58,966
塔莎: 我可以给你第二名和卡牌
Tasha: I can give you the second place and the cards

339
00:55:08,033 --> 00:55:09,533
杰克: 谢斌主还能拿第二？
Jake: Xie Binzhu can still take the second place?

340
00:55:09,533 --> 00:55:10,333
杰克: 那很厉害
Jake: That's impressive

341
00:55:15,133 --> 00:55:15,766
舒尔: 说实话
Shure: Honestly

342
00:55:15,766 --> 00:55:18,533
舒尔: 其实，其他6个可能是机器人
Shure: Actually, the other 6 are probably bots

343
00:55:19,233 --> 00:55:20,366
杰克: 哈哈哈
Jake: Hahaha

344
00:55:20,366 --> 00:55:21,833
塔莎: 所以我们打不过他们
Tasha: So we can't beat them

345
00:55:21,833 --> 00:55:22,766
塔莎: 你知道吗？
Tasha: You know?

346
00:55:23,233 --> 00:55:24,533
杰克: 哦，机器人挺强的
Jake: Oh, bots are quite strong

347
00:55:25,466 --> 00:55:29,166
舒尔: 不，所以他没打败一个人类
Shure: No, so he didn't beat a single human

348
00:55:29,166 --> 00:55:30,866
舒尔: 他是人类中最差的
Shure: He is the worst among humans

349
00:55:36,966 --> 00:55:39,433
舒尔: 我们左边的这个RGB是干嘛的？
Shure: What's this RGB on our left for?

350
00:55:40,166 --> 00:55:41,533
杰克: 你说这盏灯？
Jake: You mean this light?

351
00:55:43,833 --> 00:55:44,966
杰克: 就是灯
Jake: It's just light

352
00:55:45,766 --> 00:55:47,433
杰克: 然后它散开
Jake: Then it disperses

353
00:55:49,100 --> 00:55:50,133
杰克: 是白光
Jake: It's white light

354
00:55:50,300 --> 00:55:52,500
杰克: 然后它朝那个方向散开
Jake: Then it disperses in that direction

355
00:55:52,500 --> 00:55:53,266
杰克: 它就散开了
Jake: It just disperses

356
00:55:53,266 --> 00:55:54,700
塔莎: 我谁都打不过
Tasha: I can't beat anyone

357
00:55:55,700 --> 00:55:57,566
塔莎: 不，你为什么不争第二？
Tasha: No, why don't you aim for second place?

358
00:56:03,733 --> 00:56:04,466
塔莎: 哈哈，怎么了？
Tasha: Haha, what's up?

359
00:57:29,266 --> 00:57:31,566
塔莎: 嘿，三星Udyr
Tasha: Hey, a three-star Udyr

360
00:57:31,833 --> 00:57:35,166
塔莎: 就这样，我等着
Tasha: Just like that, I'll wait

361
00:57:36,033 --> 00:57:39,133
舒尔: 不，那是镜像的。
Shure: No, that's mirrored.

362
00:57:39,433 --> 00:57:40,300
塔莎: 真的吗？
Tasha: Really?

363
00:57:40,933 --> 00:57:42,233
舒尔: 你不给他装这个吗？
Shure: Aren't you going to install this for him?

364
00:57:42,233 --> 00:57:43,233
塔莎: 我的天。
Tasha: Oh my gosh.

365
00:57:43,633 --> 00:57:44,533
塔莎: 我没装。
Tasha: I didn't install it.

366
00:57:44,533 --> 00:57:46,166
塔莎: 这是个魔法工具。
Tasha: It's a magic tool.

367
00:58:01,366 --> 00:58:03,366
舒尔: “炸弹已安放”，对吧？
Shure: "bomb has been planted", right?

368
00:58:10,566 --> 00:58:13,366
杰克: 天哪，这东西可以当闹钟用。
Jake: Oh my, this thing can be used as an alarm clock.

369
00:58:23,366 --> 00:58:24,866
卡特里娜: 你弄那只小狗。
Katrina: You make that little dog.

370
00:58:34,800 --> 00:58:37,033
塔莎: 我卖了一个两星的。
Tasha: I sold a two-star one.

371
00:58:40,233 --> 00:58:42,133
塔莎: 你在干嘛，哈哈。
Tasha: What are you doing, haha.

372
00:59:58,133 --> 00:59:59,533
塔莎: 他为什么不能装备？
Tasha: Why can't he equip it?

373
00:59:59,933 --> 01:00:02,233
尼克斯: 拜托，你给了他那个东西。
Nicous: Come on, you gave him that thing.
